# Fletching
Logs into bows, and bows into strung bows.

```table
Method                                           Cost  Profit     ROI
---------------------------------------------  ------  ------  ------
String Magic longbow (u) into Magic longbow       995     129   13.0%
String Yew longbow (u) into Yew longbow           395     110   27.8%
Cut Maple logs into Maple longbow (u)              11      55  500.0%
Cut Yew logs into Yew longbow (u)                 109      45   41.3%
Cut Yew logs into Yew shortbow (u)                109      16   14.7%
Cut Maple logs into Maple shortbow (u)             11       9   81.8%
Cut Magic logs into Magic longbow (u)             760     -18   -2.4%
String Magic shortbow (u) into Magic shortbow     753     -32   -4.2%
String Maple longbow (u) into Maple longbow       305     -36  -11.8%
String Maple shortbow (u) into Maple shortbow     258     -89  -34.5%
String Yew shortbow (u) into Yew shortbow         365    -152  -41.6%
Cut Magic logs into Magic shortbow (u)            760    -255  -33.6%
Make Mithril darts                              1,180  -1,070  -90.7%
Make Adamant darts                              1,860  -1,530  -82.3%
Make Rune darts                                10,530  -7,850  -74.5%
```
